L","c":[]},{"h":"PON Standard: GPON (ITU-T G.984.x) / EPON (IEEE 802.3ah)","c":[]},{"h":"PON Port: 1 × XPON Optical Port","c":[]},{"h":"LAN Port: 1 × 10/100/1000 Mbps RJ45","c":[]},{"h":"Optical Wavelength: Tx 1310nm / Rx 1490nm","c":[]},{"h":"Maximum Distance: Up to 20 km","c":[]},{"h":"Management: OMCI / OAM","c":[]},{"h":"Features: VLAN, QoS, Firewall, Remote Upgrade","c":[]},{"h":"Power Supply: DC 12V Adapter","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 01 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p>The DM (Digital Media) PTF 2251L XPON ONU is a high-performance dual-mode Optical Network Unit (ONU) designed for modern FTTH (Fiber to the Home) networks. It automatically detects and operates on both GPON and EPON networks, making it an ideal solution for Internet Service Providers (ISPs), home users, and small businesses.</p><p>Equipped with a 1×10/100/1000 Mbps Gigabit Ethernet port, the PTF 2251L delivers fast and stable wired connectivity for computers, routers, IP cameras, IPTV, and other network devices. It supports remote management, VLAN, QoS, firewall functions, and firmware upgrades, helping ensure reliable network performance and easy maintenance.</p><p>With its compact design, low power consumption, and compatibility with major GPON and EPON OLT platforms, the DM PTF 2251L XPON ONU is an excellent choice for residential broadband and enterprise FTTH deployments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>Dual-Mode XPON (GPON &amp; EPON Auto Detection)</li><li>1 × Gigabit Ethernet (10/100/1000 Mbps) LAN Port</li><li>Supports FTTH Broadband Networks</li><li>Compatible with GPON and EPON OLTs</li><li>OMCI/OAM Remote Management</li><li>VLAN &amp; QoS Support</li><li>Built-in Firewall Protection</li><li>Remote Firmware Upgrade</li><li>Low Power Consumption</li><li>Compact Desktop Design</li><li>Easy Plug-and-Play Installation</li></ul>\n              "},